    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63941" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοφ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have a crest</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>), of
